\[\begin{array}{r}\text{dn}\left(.19\left|\frac{360}{361}\right|\right)=.982267 \\ \text{[(.191145)(1.01810)+.19]}\text{dn}\left(.20|.81\right)=.984056\\ \text{cn (.20|.81)}=.980278.\end{array}\]

Thus dn (.20|.81)=.98406.

